{"verse_key": "10:46", "surah": 10, "verse": 46, "text_uthmani": "وَإِمَّا نُرِيَنَّكَ بَعْضَ ٱلَّذِى نَعِدُهُمْ أَوْ نَتَوَفَّيَنَّكَ فَإِلَيْنَا مَرْجِعُهُمْ ثُمَّ ٱللَّهُ شَهِيدٌ عَلَىٰ مَا يَفْعَلُونَ", "translation": "And whether We show you some of what We promise them, [O Muḥammad], or We take you in death, to Us is their return; then, [either way], Allāh is a witness concerning what they are doing.", "verse_from_ms": 1104750, "verse_to_ms": 1122720, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَإِمَّا", "start_ms": 1104750, "end_ms": 1106630}, {"i": 1, "text": "نُرِيَنَّكَ", "start_ms": 1106630, "end_ms": 1108290}, {"i": 2, "text": "بَعْضَ", "start_ms": 1108290, "end_ms": 1108780}, {"i": 3, "text": "ٱلَّذِى", "start_ms": 1108780, "end_ms": 1109590}, {"i": 4, "text": "نَعِدُهُمْ", "start_ms": 1109590, "end_ms": 1110610}, {"i": 5, "text": "أَوْ", "start_ms": 1110610, "end_ms": 1110870}, {"i": 6, "text": "نَتَوَفَّيَنَّكَ", "start_ms": 1110870, "end_ms": 1113210}, {"i": 7, "text": "فَإِلَيْنَا", "start_ms": 1113210, "end_ms": 1114350}, {"i": 8, "text": "مَرْجِعُهُمْ", "start_ms": 1114350, "end_ms": 1115520}, {"i": 9, "text": "ثُمَّ", "start_ms": 1115520, "end_ms": 1116540}, {"i": 10, "text": "ٱللَّهُ", "start_ms": 1116540, "end_ms": 1117470}, {"i": 11, "text": "شَهِيدٌ", "start_ms": 1117470, "end_ms": 1118410}, {"i": 12, "text": "عَلَىٰ", "start_ms": 1118410, "end_ms": 1119100}, {"i": 13, "text": "مَا", "start_ms": 1119100, "end_ms": 1119550}, {"i": 14, "text": "يَفْعَلُونَ", "start_ms": 1119550, "end_ms": 1122265}]}